  "description": "Generate all combinations of well-formed parentheses for n=3.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1. function backtrack(result, current_string, open, close, max):\n2.   if length of current_string == max * 2: add current_string to result; return\n3.   if open < max: backtrack(result, current_string + '(', open + 1, close, max)\n4.   if close < open: backtrack(result, current_string + ')', open, close + 1, max)",
